  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Sudan Emergency WASH Manager (additional assignment)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of UNICEF.Following the current crisis in Sudan, the WASH service&apos;s needs has increased in the affected hotspot locations, in Internally Displaced Person (IDP) and transit sites. UNICEF&apos;s WASH staff needs enhancing and this is in process. The StandBy Partnership (SBP) will be an interim gap-filling arrangement for the immediate need, while the recruitment and onboarding process is completed.</narrative>
  </description>
